    <string name="native_tweaks_title" formatted="false">Advanced tweaks</string>
    <string name="native_tweaks_intro" formatted="false">Every engine setting, for people who want to try them. Auto is what we measured best on real phones; anything you set here wins. A value your phone can\'t run is adjusted, never fatal.</string>
