    <string name="native_settings_adaptiveNote" formatted="false">Picks a model per question from the ones installed, and can check the answer against its sources.</string>
    <string name="native_drawer_settings" formatted="false">Settings</string>
    <string name="native_about_airGappedBody" formatted="false">BOAR is an offline-first mobile AI system exploring adaptive model routing, local retrieval, and resource-aware inference. It runs local LLM inference with llama.cpp, built into the app, and local hybrid retrieval (SQLite FTS5 + on-device embeddings) with zero cloud dependencies.</string>
    <string name="native_drawer_evaluation" formatted="false">🧪 Evaluation</string>
    <string name="native_eval_adaptiveLater" formatted="false">Adaptive routing isn\'t in the native build yet, so only fixed models are listed.</string>
    <string name="native_eval_keepScreenOn" formatted="false">Keep the screen on and the app open while it runs. The chat\'s model is unloaded first so the two don\'t share memory.</string>
    <string name="native_chat_loadCrashed" formatted="false">{{crashed}} closed the app while loading (not enough memory), so BOAR is answering with {{fallback}}. Pick it again in the Model Catalog to retry.</string>
    <string name="native_chat_loadCrashedNoFallback" formatted="false">{{crashed}} closed the app while loading (not enough memory). Pick a smaller model in the Model Catalog.</string>
    <string name="native_tweaks_thinking" formatted="false">Thinking before answering</string>
    <string name="native_tweaks_thinkingNote" formatted="false">Lets a thinking model reason first. Auto: off, so the answer\'s token budget isn\'t spent on reasoning.</string>
    <string name="native_tweaks_repack" formatted="false">Repacked weights</string>
    <string name="native_tweaks_repackNote" formatted="false">Auto: on (prompts read about 2x faster). After a load that ran out of memory, the next one keeps the weights mapped from storage.</string>
